  Id: CommanderMode
  Title: Commander overview
  Pages:
  - 'Press A for commander overview: map left, management right. Movement and turning
    remain available. Select a card and press the right trigger on a valid cell to
    build. Select a tower to show its range on both maps and to upgrade, repair or
    sell. Right grip cancels a build; A closes overview.'
